    ],
    "text": "Order under Section 24A (1)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      525.22,
      549.76,
      562.29
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 24A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education in consultation with theUniversity Grants Commission do, by this Order,\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      574.22,
      549.77,
      611.29
    ],
    "text": "(1) establish with e\ufb00 ect from 18th February, 2025 the Institute of Allergology and Immunology, University of Sri Jayewardenepura as an Institute for Higher Learning for the purpose of providing, promoting and developing higher education; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      626.22,
      549.75,
      651.29
    ],
    "text": "(2) assign to such Institute the name and style of the \u201cInstitute of Allergology and Immunology, University of Sri Jayewardenepura\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
